    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Part 3B Superannuation data and payment regulations and standards Division 1 Superannuation data and payment regulations and standards.",
            "block_bbox": [
                143,
                1,
                826,
                58
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 34L ",
            "block_bbox": [
                149,
                91,
                300,
                113
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(f) to avoid doubt, any payment or information of a kind mentioned in paragraphs (a) to (e) and made or provided by the Commissioner of Taxation.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                317,
                157,
                976,
                237
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Adoption of other instruments.",
            "block_bbox": [
                300,
                271,
                613,
                294
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(7) The regulations or standards may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in any other instrument or writing:",
            "block_bbox": [
                257,
                316,
                980,
                423
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or ",
            "block_bbox": [
                316,
                432,
                838,
                456
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) as in force or existing from time to time..",
            "block_bbox": [
                315,
                465,
                797,
                489
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(8) Subsection (7) has effect despite anything in subsection 14(2) of.the Legislation Act 2003.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                511,
                998,
                564
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Consultations in preparing superannuation data and payment standards \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                295,
                595,
                979,
                648
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(9) The Commissioner of Taxation must consult with APRA in preparing the superannuation data and payment standards..Note:For further consultation requirements, see section 17 of the Legislation Act 2003.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                251,
                673,
                956,
                790
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(10) A failure to comply with subsection (9) does not affect the validity \nor enforceability of the superannuation data and payment.\nstandards.\n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                239,
                814,
                1049,
                898
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "34L Relationship between standards and other law ",
            "block_bbox": [
                161,
                937,
                829,
                962
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) A superannuation data and payment standard may elaborate on or supplement any aspect of regulations made under this Part.",
            "block_bbox": [
                258,
                985,
                1042,
                1042
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) However, a superannuation data and payment standard is of no effect to the extent that it conflicts with this Act or the regulations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                259,
                1064,
                1046,
                1117
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 14
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
